# Project Context

- This repository contains a native iOS app written in Swift and SwiftUI.
- The app should support a mostly on-device voice interaction flow.
- Speech-to-text, language generation, and text-to-speech must remain modular.
- Favor privacy, local processing, low latency, and simple maintainable code.
- Prefer incremental edits over broad rewrites.
- Do not modify unrelated files.